<PageTitle>Menubar — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Menubar</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Once any menu is open, hovering another opens that one instead of doing nothing. That is what
    makes a menubar feel like a menubar, and it is the only part of it that is not free — the
    panels themselves are the same <code>[popover]</code> as a dropdown.
</p>

